  "contracts": [
    "P65 stock calendar generator0xc7efc8c renders96x96 launcher_icon.bin background; localtime resulttm mday+12/month+16/year+20/Sundayweekday+24. Day style0x3c4798a0=>Medium46, weekdaystyle0x3c479810=>Medium20.",
    "Stock delayed0xc7efe50 saves snapshot to /data/quickapp/app/perpetual_calendar/calendar_icon.bin then launcher_update0xc7ec744(69). Module writes independent alternating filebanks; never overwrites stock and uses no appdescriptorRAM hook.",
    "P65 image source+52,width+64,height+68,type+92. ARGB8888 buffer header12,data_size+12,pixels+16,originalallocation+20. Mutablebit2,allocatedbit16,premultipliedbit1. Native premultiply0xc719b70 performsRGB*alpha>>8 and setsbit1.",
    "Image snapshot_to_buf0xc7417c0 with caller-owned buffer protects lifetime across failed GPUfinish; native allocating snapshot0xc7419b4 frees on failed draw before caller fence so is not used.",
    "Healthy serializedUI only: successful GPUfinish then inspect all drawunitsactive+24/dispatcher+12; exactnativewait0xc72ef2c drains CPUglyph/image/gradient references before deleting tree,freeing buffer,releasing managed wrappers. FailedGPUfinish retains exactlyone bounded rendergeneration until retry/reset.",
    "Image contexts retain BIN naturaldimensions and configsize applies onlytext. Explicittextsizes use owned managed40-bytewrappers(manager,key8), released after labeldeletion and pendingCPUglyphdrain. No backendfontcache mutation.",
    "Coordinator renders onlycustom calendar. Restore defaults clearsbankredirection before targetedstocklauncherrefresh; no native stockregeneration or writingoriginalfile."
  ],
  "cache_contract": "Installed drawbuf handler table0x3c450108+12=>0xc72f021 invalidate,+16=>0xc72f02d clean. Both exactP65 platformhandlers are no-op bodies; knownidentities required before drawing. Cleandescriptor before snapshot,invalidatepixelrange afterGPUfinish before nativepremultiply/filewrite. Independently decompiled no-op bodies, aligned with blur-agent recovery.",
  "stock_file_preflight": "Native launcher onlyselects generatedlogicalkey if originalstockproducerfileexists; customrender read-onlyopens it beforeallocating/drawing,missingfile fails and preserves priorpublication. Module nevercreates/overwritesstock to satisfy access.",
  "validation": [
    "build/p65-tests/bin/python tests/test_p65_calendar_native.py:9testsPASS; originalnativepremultiplyexecuted, otherLVGL/GPU/OSleavesmodeled. NoGPUorrealdeviceclaim."
  ]
}
